Notes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Enumeration completed ~1 ms after reset release. The address query is a
  fast synchronous transaction and the codec was already ready by the end of
  the 20 ms settle.
- chip id byte0 = 0x00 is a supplementary read, not part of the proof. It
  returned without error; interpreting WCD9320 chip-id bytes belongs to the
  next milestone.
- Harmless at t=2.47s, before any of this:
  "Failed to create device link (0x180) with supplier remoteproc for
